      <ol>
        <li>Foundation: organization, outlet, warehouse, user, role, pharmacy config.</li>
        <li>Master data: product, supplier, category, drug class, manufacturer, unit conversion, pricing.</li>
        <li>Inventory engine: stock batch, stock movement ledger, FEFO deduction, stock balance calculation, kartu stok.</li>
        <li>Procurement: defecta, purchase order, goods receipt, supplier invoice/hutang simple.</li>
        <li>Stock control: opname, mutation, retur, expired handling.</li>
        <li>POS: sale, payment, shift, struk, etiket sederhana.</li>
        <li>Reports & dashboard: sales, stock, purchase, gross profit, performance.</li>
      </ol>
